# Agent model (CLAUDE.md §7): the gates byte-compare generated LF text with the
# checked-out files (asset-inventory, mistake-memory). With core.autocrlf on a
# Windows checkout these files would become CRLF and the gates report a FALSE
# drift. Pin only the agent-model paths to LF; Kanflow's own files keep the
# repository's existing line-ending behaviour.
.claude/**              text eol=lf
scripts/**              text eol=lf
MISTAKES.md             text eol=lf
docs/asset-inventory.md text eol=lf
CLAUDE.md               text eol=lf
.gitattributes          text eol=lf

# Mistake-memory records are appended on every branch: union merge keeps both
# sides (duplicates are collapsed by `node scripts/mistakes.js dedupe`).
.claude/mistakes/records.jsonl merge=union

# Binary assets that may live under the agent-model paths.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.db   binary
